                                "sense_id": "fa3deece-29f5-3504-8def-71f8fcfedf9b",
                                "text": "But Mary J. goes all-out during big leg day, and look at her wheels—toned but very feminine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99bf254c-0479-439c-b89d-e7f2453ac4d4",
                                "sense_id": "fa3deece-29f5-3504-8def-71f8fcfedf9b",
